      "refersTo": "button-white",
      "description": "Large white action as used on the azure closing section.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-closing-surface\"><a class=\"ds-white\" href=\"#demo\">Isprobajte aisistent <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-closing-surface{background:#2058df;padding:24px;text-align:center}.ds-white{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 23px;min-height:54px;border:0;color:var(--blue-dark,#1749c8);background:#fff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}.ds-white:hover{background:#e9f0ff;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-white:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6b91ef;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-white{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Playback Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "playback-button",
      "description": "The simulator control in its initial play state; playback behavior lives in React.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-play\" type=\"button\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 3 14 9-14 9z\"/></svg>Pokreni razgovor</button>",
      "css": ".ds-play{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;min-height:48px;gap:10px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--blue,#2159e8);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,transform .18s}.ds-play:hover{background:#164bd1;transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-play:active{transform:translateY(0)}.ds-play:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7598f3;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-play{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
